  "description": "Higher-order workloads for P8 (docs/closures-design.md, Exit criteria): a closure that grows each iteration, dictionary-passing polymorphic recursion, a StateT-over-Except loop (with the library's bind, declined by register allocation, and with a bind written for the stack, within seven parameters), partial and over-application through a stored closure, and a fuel-indexed record of closures. Compiled through the closures step (the roots' entries and P8).",
